WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.348 --> 00:56.518
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 16]

01:35.119 --> 01:37.399
The one sitting inside,
you better show yourself!

01:40.599 --> 01:41.720
Mr. Fan,

01:41.959 --> 01:44.399
these youngsters have
quite the background.

01:44.480 --> 01:47.880
Their fathers are either
dukes or marquises.

01:50.440 --> 01:52.080
Sons of those nobles and generals?

01:53.119 --> 01:55.060
I suppose they are just nobles.

01:55.080 --> 01:57.160
Some must be from the military family.

02:00.399 --> 02:01.600
Right.

02:02.360 --> 02:04.039
But we can't fight them

02:04.039 --> 02:05.720
in public.

02:06.119 --> 02:06.759
I have taken note...

02:06.759 --> 02:07.579
He is scared.

02:07.599 --> 02:09.039
of their faces.

02:09.780 --> 02:10.979
Why don't we teach them some lessons

02:10.999 --> 02:13.919
in private afterward?

02:14.880 --> 02:16.959
As long as we don't show our faces,

02:17.880 --> 02:19.300
we can beat them up

02:19.320 --> 02:20.639
however we want.

02:23.239 --> 02:24.440
That sounds right.

02:24.920 --> 02:26.160
But today,

02:26.320 --> 02:28.039
I feel like showing my face.

02:38.959 --> 02:40.440
So you are Fan Xian?

02:40.519 --> 02:42.280
I heard that you brat took over

02:42.559 --> 02:43.760
the Baoyue Pleasure House.

02:43.760 --> 02:45.680
Cut your crap.

02:48.600 --> 02:51.079
Do you know whose property
the Baoyue Pleasure House is?

02:51.320 --> 02:53.400
You are in no place

02:53.439 --> 02:55.900
to take over His Highness' property.

02:55.920 --> 02:58.340
Be sensible and return it.

02:58.360 --> 03:00.720
I will spare your life.

03:02.519 --> 03:04.120
I see, it's the Third Prince.

03:04.719 --> 03:05.840
Let me guess.

03:06.439 --> 03:08.440
He doesn't know about this, right?

03:08.839 --> 03:10.360
You want to claim
the Baoyue Pleasure House

03:10.360 --> 03:12.400
to impress His Highness.

03:14.719 --> 03:16.039
What's with that huff?

03:16.360 --> 03:17.119
Do you know

03:17.119 --> 03:18.680
you are causing him trouble?

03:19.519 --> 03:20.880
Your threats are empty.

03:20.959 --> 03:22.539
Just hand over the property.

03:22.559 --> 03:23.860
Believe it or not,

03:23.880 --> 03:25.020
if you don't,

03:25.040 --> 03:26.480
I'm going to take your life right here.

03:26.480 --> 03:27.560
I doubt it.

03:29.119 --> 03:31.759
You don't think I dare kill you here?

03:37.760 --> 03:39.680
Get him!

04:02.239 --> 04:03.759
I'm falling!

04:08.080 --> 04:09.199
Two injured.

04:10.679 --> 04:11.759
Three

04:13.160 --> 04:14.240
injured.

04:24.439 --> 04:26.970
These brats actually
have the nerve to mess with Fan Xian.

04:26.990 --> 04:29.000
They have been well-protected
since little,

04:29.119 --> 04:30.260
yet they are still so naive

04:30.280 --> 04:31.599
at this age.

04:32.439 --> 04:34.560
If so, we should get prepared

04:34.800 --> 04:37.480
to take this advantage against Fan Xian.

04:40.720 --> 04:43.000
He always wants to seek justice,
doesn't he?

04:43.720 --> 04:45.759
Let's grant him his wish.

04:46.119 --> 04:48.299
Go to Ye's Residence to see Ye Ling'er.

04:48.319 --> 04:50.140
Tell her that I'm grounded,
I can't go out.

04:50.160 --> 04:52.800
I would like to invite her over.

04:52.999 --> 04:54.180
I don't think she would come.

04:54.200 --> 04:56.599
Tell her it's about the conflict
between me and Fan Xian.

04:56.999 --> 04:58.320
She will come.

04:59.079 --> 05:01.419
Miss Ye and Princess Lin are tight.

05:01.439 --> 05:03.060
She also gets along well with Fan Xian.

05:03.080 --> 05:04.500
She might not take your side

05:04.520 --> 05:05.800
to confront Fan Xian.

05:18.079 --> 05:19.240
I need someone

05:19.559 --> 05:20.839
to bring me a ladder.

05:22.840 --> 05:23.959
Move!

05:24.600 --> 05:25.619
Clear the way!

05:25.639 --> 05:26.659
How dare you!

05:26.679 --> 05:27.759
Mr. Fan,

05:27.960 --> 05:29.260
I'm late.

05:29.280 --> 05:30.519
Move aside!

05:34.079 --> 05:36.240
Do you recognize these people?

05:37.079 --> 05:38.159
I do.

05:38.199 --> 05:39.480
Their parents

05:39.679 --> 05:42.120
are the court...

05:43.960 --> 05:45.560
Are you sure?

05:49.439 --> 05:50.519
I made

05:51.040 --> 05:52.199
a mistake?

05:56.920 --> 05:59.480
I don't know them at all.

05:59.920 --> 06:02.580
These unknown brats

06:02.600 --> 06:04.820
tried to stop the inspector's carriage
in the middle of the road.

06:04.840 --> 06:06.759
Should I

06:08.079 --> 06:08.739
arrest them?

06:08.759 --> 06:09.839
You decide.

06:14.119 --> 06:15.419
Take them away!

06:15.439 --> 06:16.519
Yes!

06:17.800 --> 06:18.820
Get up!

06:18.840 --> 06:19.759
How dare you arrest me!

06:19.760 --> 06:22.030
Aren't you afraid
of your whole family being executed?

06:24.079 --> 06:25.219
- Stay still.
- Gentlemen,

06:25.239 --> 06:27.360
do them a favor and shut up.

06:28.800 --> 06:30.859
Mr. Fan, do I really arrest them?

06:30.879 --> 06:31.959
Of course.

06:32.400 --> 06:33.340
And then?

06:33.360 --> 06:34.519
Then,

06:35.239 --> 06:36.559
search them for silver taels

06:36.559 --> 06:38.099
to compensate the affected shop owners.

06:38.119 --> 06:40.079
These brats used too much strength.

06:41.119 --> 06:42.059
Isn't Mr. Fan

06:42.079 --> 06:43.920
wise and compassionate?

06:44.439 --> 06:45.519
Off you go.

06:47.280 --> 06:49.639
I suppose the Second Prince plotted this

06:49.679 --> 06:52.580
to divide you and the Third Prince.

06:52.600 --> 06:53.680
I know.

06:53.960 --> 06:54.950
Let's not fall into his trap.

06:54.970 --> 06:56.099
Go to the First Division.

06:56.119 --> 06:56.800
All right.

06:56.820 --> 06:58.220
Surrender all your money.

07:07.480 --> 07:08.500
Wang Qinian.

07:08.520 --> 07:09.759
Yes, Mr. Fan.

07:09.960 --> 07:11.820
Change the route to the palace.

07:11.840 --> 07:12.859
Wait, Mr. Fan.

07:12.879 --> 07:14.906
We can't fall into his trap.

07:14.926 --> 07:17.525
I'm angry and just can't get over this.

07:40.559 --> 07:41.820
What is he doing up there?

07:41.840 --> 07:42.920
No idea.

07:43.280 --> 07:45.120
Is this the way he entertains his guests?

07:45.520 --> 07:46.600
No.

07:48.280 --> 07:49.759
Should I go up there too?

07:50.910 --> 07:52.120
You don't have to.

07:52.319 --> 07:54.639
His Highness said it's your choice.

08:20.759 --> 08:22.240
Thank you for coming here.

08:23.239 --> 08:25.199
I prepared all this for you.

08:25.759 --> 08:26.839
Help yourself.

08:30.520 --> 08:32.079
Why are you sitting here?

08:32.599 --> 08:34.320
Would you believe me

08:35.494 --> 08:39.479
if I said it was a misunderstanding
between Fan Xian and me?

08:40.439 --> 08:42.220
But look what you two have become.

08:42.240 --> 08:44.620
Still, I admire him deep inside.

08:44.640 --> 08:45.940
You should tell him.

08:45.960 --> 08:47.560
Why did you invite me here instead?

08:49.559 --> 08:51.400
He might not come.

08:52.150 --> 08:53.910
Our misunderstanding has run too deep.

08:56.479 --> 08:57.760
Honestly,

08:57.920 --> 09:00.199
I have never played dirty tricks
against him.

09:00.560 --> 09:02.440
If you don't believe me,
look into my eyes.

09:06.079 --> 09:08.999
I swear on the dignity
of the imperial family.

09:18.199 --> 09:19.800
May I ask,

09:20.479 --> 09:22.400
why are you telling me all this?

09:26.439 --> 09:28.079
I was forced to.

09:30.760 --> 09:32.380
Can you tell me

09:32.400 --> 09:35.280
who can force a prince?

09:39.520 --> 09:40.640
His Majesty.

09:43.479 --> 09:44.939
I want to stay out of conflicts.

09:44.959 --> 09:46.239
He won't let me.

09:46.640 --> 09:49.040
He praised me
in front of those officials,

09:49.719 --> 09:51.299
made me a lord at 13,

09:51.319 --> 09:53.299
and let me attend the court session
at 15.

09:53.319 --> 09:55.140
He wouldn't allow me
to leave the Capital.

09:55.160 --> 09:58.239
He offered me chances
to form alliances with the officials.

09:58.840 --> 10:00.719
How will the Crown Prince think of me?

10:02.319 --> 10:04.599
If I said I never meant to compete,
would he believe me?

10:09.520 --> 10:12.800
Hence, I can only obey and move forward.

10:13.160 --> 10:14.380
If I were

10:14.400 --> 10:16.400
to turn back now,

10:17.920 --> 10:21.119
I would die a pathetic death.

10:23.479 --> 10:25.320
Why did His Majesty do so?

10:26.040 --> 10:28.339
He makes me a pacemaker
for the Crown Prince.

10:28.359 --> 10:29.900
That's a treasonous thing to say.

10:29.920 --> 10:32.999
That's why I say it on the roof.
No one hears me.

10:36.319 --> 10:37.900
If you are afraid of that,

10:37.920 --> 10:39.479
why are you telling me?

10:43.520 --> 10:45.359
We are engaged.

10:45.839 --> 10:47.599
Since we can't defy this marriage,

10:47.920 --> 10:50.400
we have a shared destiny

10:50.760 --> 10:52.479
for the rest of our lives.

10:53.719 --> 10:55.560
If I must

10:56.760 --> 10:58.800
find someone in this world

10:58.920 --> 11:00.479
to open my heart to,

11:02.839 --> 11:04.680
it should be you.

11:20.199 --> 11:22.599
By now, you should believe

11:23.719 --> 11:25.280
that I mean no harm

11:27.479 --> 11:28.800
to Fan Xian.

11:29.280 --> 11:30.479
Hold on.

11:30.839 --> 11:32.320
I'm confused.

11:34.880 --> 11:38.079
You confessed to your fiancee

11:38.199 --> 11:42.640
to prove that it was a misunderstanding
between you and Fan Xian.

11:44.439 --> 11:46.419
It doesn't feel right, though.

11:46.439 --> 11:48.320
I'm grounded now.

11:48.880 --> 11:50.640
Except for you,

11:53.359 --> 11:55.199
no one will see me.

11:55.326 --> 11:56.179
So?

11:56.199 --> 11:57.999
So I would like you

11:58.959 --> 12:01.059
to deliver a memorandum to the palace.

12:01.079 --> 12:01.980
What memorandum?

12:02.000 --> 12:02.930
A recommendation letter.

12:02.950 --> 12:03.900
Who are you recommending?

12:03.920 --> 12:05.359
Fan Xian.

12:27.800 --> 12:28.490
Keep talking.

12:28.510 --> 12:31.110
According to the latest news
from the Imperial Inspectorate,

12:31.800 --> 12:34.459
there were peers interrupting
Fan Xian's carriage on the street.

12:34.479 --> 12:36.539
Fan Xian injured three of them.

12:36.559 --> 12:38.079
Now, they are all detained

12:38.719 --> 12:40.280
in the First Division.

12:40.520 --> 12:42.490
That's trivial, though.

12:42.510 --> 12:44.560
Why did you have to report this
personally?

12:45.319 --> 12:49.640
I wanted to avoid noise.

12:51.679 --> 12:52.559
You may now know about this.

12:52.559 --> 12:55.940
All those dukes are crowding
at the Imperial Inspectorate's entrance.

12:55.960 --> 12:57.719
They want me to release their sons.

12:58.640 --> 13:01.599
That's why you hid here?

13:01.959 --> 13:04.900
There is no other quiet place

13:04.920 --> 13:07.680
than here, Your Majesty.

13:15.520 --> 13:17.199
Why did you back off?

13:17.439 --> 13:18.599
Your Majesty,

13:20.760 --> 13:23.760
is this the gunpowder?

13:25.559 --> 13:26.639
Yes.

13:33.400 --> 13:34.520
Tell me.

13:37.640 --> 13:40.539
Does the First Division
not want to release them?

13:40.559 --> 13:42.819
Your Majesty, it was Fan Xian
who arrested them.

13:42.839 --> 13:45.140
I will have to ask Fan Xian
before releasing them.

13:45.160 --> 13:46.719
Go look for him, then.

13:47.760 --> 13:48.959
Fan Xian...

13:50.439 --> 13:52.560
He is also hiding in the palace.

13:56.280 --> 13:57.360
Kneel.

14:06.199 --> 14:07.920
Do you own the Baoyue Pleasure House?

14:08.040 --> 14:09.839
Fan Sizhe is the first owner.

14:10.160 --> 14:11.640
So you got a share in this.

14:11.990 --> 14:13.439
Fan Sizhe said
it was a lucrative business.

14:13.439 --> 14:14.640
If Fan Sizhe tells you to eat poop,

14:14.640 --> 14:15.659
will you eat that too?

14:15.679 --> 14:17.440
Fan Sizhe wouldn't do that.

14:18.679 --> 14:20.800
Why are you defending him?

14:21.199 --> 14:22.640
He didn't.

14:23.520 --> 14:24.920
How dare you egg on those young masters

14:24.920 --> 14:26.040
to block Fan Xian's carriage!

14:26.040 --> 14:26.939
I didn't.

14:26.959 --> 14:27.820
Let me ask you one more time.

14:27.840 --> 14:28.539
Are you behind this?

14:28.559 --> 14:29.179
No.

14:29.199 --> 14:31.479
Fine, you are still denying it.

14:32.319 --> 14:33.220
Maids.

14:33.240 --> 14:34.900
Bring me the rattan cane!

14:34.920 --> 14:37.400
Mother, I didn't instruct them
to stop the carriage.

14:37.920 --> 14:39.920
Aunt Liu, please calm down.

14:39.959 --> 14:42.079
His Highness wouldn't do
such silly things.

14:46.079 --> 14:47.939
What's wrong with you people?

14:47.959 --> 14:49.819
Why are you still fishing here

14:49.839 --> 14:51.220
when Aunt Liu is so angry?

14:51.240 --> 14:53.320
Bring her the cane right now.

14:57.975 --> 14:59.220
[Concubine Yi, mother of Third Prince]

14:59.240 --> 15:00.450
You better own up!

15:00.470 --> 15:01.459
- Mother!
- Own up already!

15:01.479 --> 15:02.100
It hurts.

15:02.120 --> 15:03.239
No?

15:03.359 --> 15:04.419
Own up!

15:04.439 --> 15:04.980
Mother.

15:05.000 --> 15:06.539
Own up now!

15:06.559 --> 15:07.280
Mother, please stop.

15:07.280 --> 15:08.479
Brat!

15:08.920 --> 15:10.900
Aunt Liu, please calm down.

15:10.920 --> 15:12.179
You are going nowhere!

15:12.199 --> 15:13.100
Nowhere!

15:13.120 --> 15:14.539
Don't you run!

15:14.559 --> 15:15.680
Don't run!

15:16.280 --> 15:17.760
I'm going to beat you to death!

15:17.839 --> 15:19.520
Aunt Liu, take a break.

15:19.520 --> 15:20.500
Brat!

15:20.520 --> 15:22.079
You are so disappointing!

15:23.000 --> 15:25.220
Aunt Liu, please take a sip.

15:25.240 --> 15:26.880
It wasn't me, Mother.

15:26.880 --> 15:27.939
Brat!

15:27.959 --> 15:28.479
Stop beating me.

15:28.479 --> 15:29.710
Give me a minute. Let me beat him first.

15:29.730 --> 15:30.880
There isn't much to do on rainy days.

15:30.880 --> 15:32.670
I might as well
give him a good spanking.

15:32.760 --> 15:33.539
Own up!

15:33.559 --> 15:34.980
Mother, I didn't.

15:35.000 --> 15:37.380
Aunt Liu, do you want to stop
and go fishing?

15:37.400 --> 15:38.712
The maids are here watching this.

15:38.732 --> 15:40.180
I don't care who is here.

15:40.200 --> 15:41.380
Fishing helps me pass the time,

15:41.400 --> 15:42.860
and so does caning him.

15:42.880 --> 15:44.040
Own up!

15:44.640 --> 15:46.500
Stop denying!

15:46.520 --> 15:48.479
I didn't do that!

15:49.800 --> 15:50.999
Brat!

15:51.959 --> 15:54.079
Please stop, Mother!

15:56.520 --> 15:58.020
Is she canning him with a rattan?

15:58.040 --> 15:59.520
Indeed.

16:01.359 --> 16:04.500
Do you think we should go
and take a look?

16:04.520 --> 16:05.680
It's too late.

16:07.400 --> 16:08.299
It's done.

16:08.319 --> 16:09.599
That's fast.

16:09.640 --> 16:12.280
Fan Xian stopped her.

16:13.199 --> 16:14.279
No fun.

16:14.520 --> 16:15.719
No fun.

16:17.240 --> 16:19.599
I missed the fun.

16:23.839 --> 16:24.640
You tell me.

16:24.660 --> 16:26.260
Why do you always know
the news in the palace

16:26.280 --> 16:29.079
sooner than me?

16:31.679 --> 16:35.440
Because the Imperial Inspectorate
is your discerning eye, Your Majesty.

16:38.400 --> 16:40.659
So Lai Mingcheng was right.

16:40.679 --> 16:44.879
The Imperial Inspectorate
has become too autonomous.

16:45.160 --> 16:46.339
He was right.

16:46.359 --> 16:47.760
I see his point now.

16:48.280 --> 16:50.140
Please reconsider that, Your Majesty.

16:50.160 --> 16:51.100
Reconsider?

16:51.120 --> 16:53.400
You always want me to reconsider.

16:53.820 --> 16:55.239
What's there to reconsider?

16:55.640 --> 16:57.939
Whatever Lai Mingcheng said was wrong.

16:57.959 --> 17:00.299
Because he was flogged to death
by your order.

17:00.319 --> 17:02.440
If he was right...

17:06.720 --> 17:08.439
Such audacity.

17:09.200 --> 17:10.540
I pledge my loyalty to you.

17:10.560 --> 17:12.240
And I speak without hiding things.

17:13.399 --> 17:14.960
Aren't you afraid

17:14.960 --> 17:17.800
of ending up like Lai Mingcheng one day?

17:19.480 --> 17:21.020
I wouldn't fear to sacrifice
for the country.

17:21.040 --> 17:22.520
As if.

17:23.359 --> 17:24.480
If you don't fear,

17:24.839 --> 17:26.520
why did you back off just now?

17:30.760 --> 17:31.879
Your Majesty,

17:32.159 --> 17:35.760
it depends on the way of dying.

17:36.919 --> 17:40.240
Smooth talker.

17:48.720 --> 17:50.099
This brat is so stubborn.

17:50.119 --> 17:51.200
Simmer down.

17:54.280 --> 17:55.360
You may go.

17:59.630 --> 18:00.639
Why did you take the cane away?

18:00.639 --> 18:02.099
I'm not done yet.

18:02.119 --> 18:02.980
Aunt Liu,

18:03.000 --> 18:04.819
I believe he knew nothing

18:04.839 --> 18:05.760
about that incident.

18:05.760 --> 18:07.159
I had no idea at all.

18:08.040 --> 18:09.480
Someone purposely did this

18:09.480 --> 18:11.359
to upset us.

18:13.919 --> 18:15.040
Stay in the palace from now on.

18:15.040 --> 18:16.200
Did you hear me?

18:18.280 --> 18:19.299
Xian,

18:19.319 --> 18:21.359
please look out for him.

18:21.399 --> 18:22.700
We are relatives.

18:22.720 --> 18:24.399
He should call you cousin.

18:24.399 --> 18:25.500
Please don't say that, Aunt Liu.

18:25.520 --> 18:26.559
His Highness is a prince.

18:26.559 --> 18:29.000
Yes, but the prince should
also respect their relatives.

18:29.200 --> 18:29.940
Greet him.

18:29.960 --> 18:31.079
Cousin Xian.

18:31.680 --> 18:33.320
Look, he is cute.

18:34.480 --> 18:35.560
Come.

18:39.839 --> 18:42.359
Are those people from noble families?

18:42.839 --> 18:44.300
Yes, they are sons of the dukes.

18:44.320 --> 18:45.579
Did you arrest all of them?

18:45.599 --> 18:46.260
Yes.

18:46.280 --> 18:47.559
You have offended a lot of people, then.

18:47.559 --> 18:48.299
I'm not afraid.

18:48.319 --> 18:50.520
Silly boy. How can it be?

18:50.599 --> 18:52.800
The officialdom is
all about people skills.

18:53.359 --> 18:54.940
His Majesty made me
an isolated official.

18:54.960 --> 18:56.839
I could only choose to be impartial.

19:02.040 --> 19:03.780
Don't tell anyone what you heard.

19:03.800 --> 19:04.880
I dare not.

19:05.760 --> 19:08.079
Oh, boy.
You can't just speak so recklessly.

19:08.350 --> 19:09.500
I won't say this outside.

19:09.520 --> 19:10.839
You are my family.

19:12.319 --> 19:14.079
It has been tough for you.

19:14.800 --> 19:15.880
Aunt Liu.

19:17.200 --> 19:19.370
Don't let him out
for the next few days.

19:19.390 --> 19:21.139
Someone might still be looking
for a chance.

19:21.159 --> 19:22.500
Don't worry. I will keep an eye on him

19:22.520 --> 19:23.899
and not let him out.

19:23.919 --> 19:24.999
I'm leaving, then.

19:26.079 --> 19:28.079
No rush. Stay for a while more.

19:28.280 --> 19:30.159
After all, you are his cousin.

19:30.159 --> 19:31.599
You are relatives.

19:31.680 --> 19:32.980
Please come here often to visit him

19:33.000 --> 19:34.720
and guide him.

19:34.760 --> 19:36.059
Just beat him if he does anything wrong.

19:36.079 --> 19:37.520
He's all yours.

19:37.800 --> 19:39.040
Is there a problem?

19:40.040 --> 19:41.159
I'm saying,

19:41.440 --> 19:43.200
please come here often, Cousin Xian.

19:45.399 --> 19:46.440
Well, you have already beaten him.

19:46.450 --> 19:47.740
I believe he will remember this lesson.

19:47.760 --> 19:48.840
Get up.

19:50.079 --> 19:51.159
Get up.

19:57.940 --> 19:59.970
Will you still go
to the Baoyue Pleasure House?

20:00.040 --> 20:00.899
No, not anymore.

20:00.919 --> 20:02.090
I was deceived.

20:02.110 --> 20:03.420
The Baoyue Pleasure House

20:03.440 --> 20:04.720
is yours from now on.

20:05.559 --> 20:07.139
Aunt Liu, I'm leaving.

20:07.159 --> 20:07.859
By the way,

20:07.879 --> 20:09.420
the palace sent some yogurt.

20:09.440 --> 20:10.899
I know this is your favorite.

20:10.919 --> 20:12.859
I will have someone
send it to your residence.

20:12.879 --> 20:14.110
The yogurt is flavorful and tasty.

20:14.119 --> 20:15.299
Thank you, Aunt Liu.

20:15.319 --> 20:16.720
Please stay for the meal.

20:16.720 --> 20:19.320
I can't. Those dukes are waiting.

20:23.399 --> 20:24.479
Xian,

20:24.680 --> 20:26.020
take care.

20:26.040 --> 20:28.119
I will. Thank you, Aunt Liu.

20:34.879 --> 20:36.960
Xian, walk slowly.

20:46.440 --> 20:48.119
Stay in touch with him.

20:48.919 --> 20:50.240
Cousin Xian?

20:51.280 --> 20:53.099
But he is competing with Chengze.

20:53.119 --> 20:54.919
Chengze is grounded now.

20:56.319 --> 20:57.599
Listen carefully.

20:57.639 --> 20:58.839
Whether or not

20:59.040 --> 21:01.119
you are safe in the future

21:01.159 --> 21:03.679
depends on Fan Xian.

21:05.720 --> 21:07.520
The Baoyue Pleasure House incident

21:07.760 --> 21:10.079
is a trap set for you.

21:11.200 --> 21:14.119
The palace is a dangerous place.

21:14.200 --> 21:16.800
To be honest, I don't want you
to stay in the Capital.

21:17.720 --> 21:19.159
Do you understand?

21:20.280 --> 21:21.360
Mother,

21:21.760 --> 21:22.960
I understand.

21:27.960 --> 21:29.960
Did I hurt you just now?

21:30.319 --> 21:31.439
Did it hurt?

21:32.639 --> 21:33.720
No.

21:33.879 --> 21:35.000
No?

21:35.319 --> 21:36.399
Not at all.

21:36.480 --> 21:38.520
How could you remember the lesson, then?

21:39.079 --> 21:40.159
Maids.

21:40.359 --> 21:41.260
Bring me

21:41.280 --> 21:43.399
the rattan cane right now!

21:45.079 --> 21:45.859
Did you all hear me?

21:45.879 --> 21:48.439
Bring me the rattan cane! Now!

21:49.480 --> 21:51.539
Brat, you had better come back here!

21:51.559 --> 21:52.220
I'm telling you,

21:52.240 --> 21:53.859
I will beat you
until you learn the lesson!

21:53.879 --> 21:55.280
Did you hear me?

21:55.319 --> 21:56.399
Come back here!

21:57.040 --> 21:58.399
I'm so furious.

22:07.639 --> 22:10.720
Your Majesty, the Ye family
hands in a memorandum.

22:11.440 --> 22:13.040
Show it to Mr. Chen.

22:13.280 --> 22:14.339
This is against the rules.

22:14.359 --> 22:17.079
It's like you never broke the rules.

22:18.879 --> 22:21.079
Everything you say is right.

22:27.720 --> 22:29.599
[Li Chengze and Ye Zhong,
Grand Commandant of the Capital]

22:29.599 --> 22:33.480
This is a joint memorandum
of the Ye family and the Second Prince.

22:33.839 --> 22:34.919
Your Majesty,

22:36.280 --> 22:39.060
Fan Xian inherits
Zhuang Mohan's collection

22:39.080 --> 22:40.899
and possesses
exceptional literary talents.

22:40.919 --> 22:41.879
They recommend Fan Xian

22:41.879 --> 22:44.420
as the examiner
for the coming spring exam.

22:44.440 --> 22:47.040
What's your read
on this recommendation letter?

22:47.599 --> 22:50.180
The Second Prince is smart.

22:50.200 --> 22:53.520
He just got confined, and now
he has submitted a joint memorandum

22:53.559 --> 22:55.200
with the Ye family,

22:55.720 --> 22:58.180
who is protected
by Grandmaster Ye Liuyun.

22:58.200 --> 22:59.879
This joint memorandum

23:00.280 --> 23:04.520
will guarantee him a bright future.

23:04.680 --> 23:07.280
I appointed his marriage
with the Ye family.

23:07.399 --> 23:10.320
He made a clever move,
but it's because of you.

23:11.839 --> 23:13.599
Is this all you can see?

23:13.680 --> 23:14.760
Besides,

23:15.480 --> 23:17.500
despite the conflict with Fan Xian,

23:17.520 --> 23:20.619
he immediately recommends him
for the post.

23:20.639 --> 23:22.599
I'm moved.

23:23.079 --> 23:24.630
Enough about personnel matters.

23:25.559 --> 23:27.079
What else should we talk about?

23:29.800 --> 23:31.439
I'm thinking

23:32.960 --> 23:35.480
if Fan Xian is able
to host the spring exam

23:37.040 --> 23:39.079
at his age.

23:45.839 --> 23:47.879
What's that face?

23:49.280 --> 23:50.639
Your Majesty.

23:53.079 --> 23:54.200
I...

23:55.680 --> 23:57.079
I can't make any comments.

23:57.440 --> 23:59.960
You said you don't want to talk
about personnel matters.

24:00.280 --> 24:02.560
But Fan Xian is a person.

24:02.639 --> 24:04.720
The spring exam is important.

24:04.720 --> 24:07.520
I wouldn't dare to overstep.

24:07.559 --> 24:11.000
I will obey your decision.

24:12.440 --> 24:14.200
Mr. Chen, you always speak

24:14.879 --> 24:17.960
with perfect discretion.

24:18.319 --> 24:22.399
Because I'm your loyal subject.

24:48.839 --> 24:50.960
I made it!

24:53.599 --> 24:55.159
Mr. Fan.

24:56.720 --> 24:58.200
Mr. Fan.

24:59.119 --> 25:00.879
His Majesty has a decree.

25:03.000 --> 25:05.200
What a coincidence.
I was just about to leave.

25:05.240 --> 25:06.579
What decree does His Majesty have?

25:06.599 --> 25:08.280
According to His Majesty,

25:09.000 --> 25:10.460
as spring exam is around the corner,

25:10.480 --> 25:13.059
Fan Xian is appointed as
the fourth-ranked Middle Examiner

25:13.079 --> 25:16.320
to monitor the spring exam.

25:18.200 --> 25:20.420
Congratulations, Mr. Fan.

25:20.440 --> 25:22.359
The current batch of scholars

25:22.720 --> 25:26.359
should revere you as "sir".

25:29.000 --> 25:30.560
Middle Examiner?

25:31.520 --> 25:32.890
This is an interesting title.

25:32.910 --> 25:34.730
Did His Majesty come up with this title?

25:34.839 --> 25:36.200
No.

25:36.599 --> 25:39.280
It has existed since ancient times.

25:39.440 --> 25:42.439
Sir, do you think

25:42.570 --> 25:44.750
I should take neither side
and stay in the middle?

25:45.839 --> 25:48.099
I wouldn't know about that.

25:48.119 --> 25:51.879
Either side you choose, you will
always take the side of His Majesty.

25:55.320 --> 25:57.119
Thank you for your reminder, Eunuch Hou.

25:57.359 --> 25:58.460
Please don't say that.

25:58.480 --> 26:00.059
This isn't a reminder.

26:00.079 --> 26:01.839
I was just saying.

26:03.839 --> 26:06.040
Well, I don't have
any silver taels with me.

26:07.399 --> 26:09.679
You must be kidding me.

26:09.919 --> 26:11.099
It isn't appropriate.

26:11.119 --> 26:13.379
I wouldn't dare to take it.

26:13.399 --> 26:15.000
I have delivered the decree.

26:15.119 --> 26:17.399
I should head back to serve His Majesty.

26:34.350 --> 26:36.970
[Fan's Residence]

26:37.760 --> 26:39.159
It's moving its head.

26:39.399 --> 26:41.280
No, it's looking at me.

26:44.760 --> 26:46.399
Xian, you are back.

26:49.460 --> 26:50.910
- Greetings, Young Master.
- Greetings, Young Master.

26:50.919 --> 26:52.320
Drop the formalities.

26:52.399 --> 26:53.619
Tell your mother

26:53.639 --> 26:54.850
to prepare a lighter meal tomorrow.

26:54.870 --> 26:56.870
- All right, Young Master.
- Got it, Young Master.

26:58.200 --> 26:59.260
Why did you come here?

26:59.280 --> 27:01.879
Were you afraid
of stitching up its wound?

27:01.960 --> 27:03.079
It's done.

27:04.000 --> 27:05.200
Done?

27:08.119 --> 27:09.560
I have already patched it up.

27:11.359 --> 27:12.960
It looks all right.

27:13.240 --> 27:14.560
You sewn it quite well.

27:14.639 --> 27:16.960
After all, I have read
a lot of medical records.

27:17.119 --> 27:17.899
By the way, Xian,

27:17.919 --> 27:19.859
the chloroform you gave
is quite effective.

27:19.879 --> 27:21.240
It didn't wake up halfway.

27:22.520 --> 27:24.280
Were you not scared?

27:25.200 --> 27:26.280
Not really.

27:26.559 --> 27:28.460
Have you ever thought
if you failed?

27:28.480 --> 27:29.839
I would roast and eat it.

27:30.000 --> 27:30.700
Right.

27:30.720 --> 27:31.680
But I think

27:31.680 --> 27:32.700
you are more suitable as a vet.

27:32.720 --> 27:35.439
No, I wouldn't think of that
when I treat humans.

27:37.760 --> 27:38.579
Ruoruo,

27:38.599 --> 27:40.460
as a physician,
not only do you have to be bold,

27:40.480 --> 27:42.860
but you also have to be meticulous
and have steady hands.

27:44.440 --> 27:45.720
What should I do?

27:50.000 --> 27:51.480
Here, pinch it.

27:52.320 --> 27:54.110
Level the needle and lift it higher.

27:58.040 --> 27:59.579
You hid so many needles in your hair.

27:59.599 --> 28:01.240
It adds volume to my hair.

28:01.559 --> 28:02.619
That makes sense.

28:02.639 --> 28:04.119
Well, enough of that.

28:08.000 --> 28:08.700
Hold it steadily.

28:08.720 --> 28:10.040
Don't let it fall.

28:12.150 --> 28:13.520
What should I do next?

28:20.680 --> 28:23.240
Your hand is quite steady.

28:23.839 --> 28:26.200
Then, you learn
how to maintain the balance while moving.

28:26.200 --> 28:28.000
First, you need to walk around.

28:28.440 --> 28:29.280
At the end of the practice,

28:29.280 --> 28:30.599
no matter how you walk,

28:30.599 --> 28:31.919
where you walk,

28:31.919 --> 28:33.079
or even with a blindfold,

28:33.079 --> 28:34.139
make sure the needle won't drop.

28:34.159 --> 28:35.720
When I practiced this back then,

28:35.720 --> 28:37.119
- my master said...
- What's next?

28:45.119 --> 28:46.320
Is this

28:46.839 --> 28:48.379
your first time?

28:48.399 --> 28:49.479
Yes.

28:51.559 --> 28:53.220
Your hand is steady.

28:53.240 --> 28:55.159
Am I pretty gifted as a physician?

28:57.760 --> 28:58.960
Kind of.

28:59.080 --> 29:00.500
Did you practice this before?

29:00.520 --> 29:01.500
Yes.

29:01.520 --> 29:04.439
Did you hold the needle
and walk around like I do?

29:06.079 --> 29:07.379
More or less.

29:07.399 --> 29:08.090
Ruoruo,

29:08.110 --> 29:09.520
no need to practice anymore.

29:10.760 --> 29:11.460
Listen.

29:11.480 --> 29:14.040
This is just the first step.

29:14.119 --> 29:15.260
It's superficial.

29:15.280 --> 29:16.500
The most insignificant skill

29:16.520 --> 29:17.839
of all.

29:18.159 --> 29:19.040
If you want to be a physician,

29:19.040 --> 29:20.339
you have to read a lot

29:20.359 --> 29:21.639
and memorize the position

29:21.639 --> 29:22.520
of the organs

29:22.520 --> 29:23.379
and acupoints.

29:23.399 --> 29:25.420
Then, get a fruit.

29:25.440 --> 29:26.240
Fruit?

29:26.240 --> 29:26.859
Yes.

29:26.879 --> 29:28.859
Cut it open and stitch it back together.

29:28.879 --> 29:29.819
Repeat this procedure

29:29.839 --> 29:30.819
and practice continuously.

29:30.839 --> 29:31.859
It's to train your dexterity

29:31.879 --> 29:32.940
and your patience.

29:32.960 --> 29:33.859
All right.

29:33.879 --> 29:35.240
Should I practice now?

29:35.520 --> 29:37.320
There is no rush.

29:37.440 --> 29:39.200
That's all for today.

29:40.000 --> 29:41.200
I'm leaving, then.

29:45.399 --> 29:47.679
Xian, I'm so forgetful.

29:48.240 --> 29:49.720
Wan'er asked for you.

30:01.000 --> 30:02.080
You are here.

30:03.159 --> 30:04.919
You figured I would come at night?

30:05.919 --> 30:07.159
Mr. Fan,

30:07.480 --> 30:11.040
you always come here at night.

30:11.559 --> 30:12.740
You are saying

30:12.760 --> 30:14.760
like I'm a bad guy.

30:17.480 --> 30:19.859
I heard about

30:19.879 --> 30:21.020
the incident earlier today.

30:21.040 --> 30:23.320
I suppose Chengze was behind this.

30:25.319 --> 30:26.520
I know.

30:26.720 --> 30:27.899
Those lads are only his pawns.

30:27.919 --> 30:29.420
Speaking of them,

30:29.440 --> 30:30.579
just beat and lecture them

30:30.599 --> 30:31.899
if you have to.

30:31.919 --> 30:33.220
With His Majesty's support,

30:33.240 --> 30:34.510
those dukes and nobles

30:34.530 --> 30:35.919
wouldn't dare to intervene.

30:36.200 --> 30:37.740
If anything were to happen,

30:37.760 --> 30:39.359
I will apologize to them.

30:39.559 --> 30:41.379
After all, I'm the princess.

30:41.399 --> 30:42.440
They could do nothing

30:42.440 --> 30:44.280
but swallowing their anger.

30:47.839 --> 30:48.919
Wan'er,

30:49.520 --> 30:51.359
we are truly a couple of geniuses.

30:57.760 --> 31:00.059
The incident earlier today
may seem dangerous,

31:00.079 --> 31:02.439
but it doesn't affect you much.

31:03.350 --> 31:05.579
If Chengze intended
to take revenge against you,

31:05.599 --> 31:07.819
he wouldn't have used
such an obvious trick.

31:07.839 --> 31:10.180
So you think he used this revenge
as a disguise?

31:10.200 --> 31:11.720
To lower your guard

31:11.919 --> 31:13.879
and mislead you.

31:14.359 --> 31:17.599
But in fact,
the sinister plan will ensue.

31:18.280 --> 31:21.439
The spring exam is the real deal.

31:22.079 --> 31:24.819
I remember the last person
who mentioned this

31:24.839 --> 31:26.079
was also him.

31:26.639 --> 31:29.520
If Chengze is going
to lay a trap against you,

31:29.720 --> 31:31.879
the spring exam is the best stage.

31:33.919 --> 31:34.720
The spring exam

31:34.720 --> 31:37.359
holds great importance
for all scholars nationwide.

31:38.040 --> 31:39.780
They study tirelessly

31:39.800 --> 31:41.760
for days and nights

31:41.919 --> 31:43.800
and endures all hardships

31:43.919 --> 31:45.559
for a chance
to own a place on the honor roll

31:45.560 --> 31:48.260
[Shi Chanli, spring exam candidate]
and climb the ladder of success.

31:48.359 --> 31:49.899
In the following days,

31:49.919 --> 31:52.760
the eyes of the world
will be on the Capital.

31:53.599 --> 31:55.720
All hopes and desperation

31:55.760 --> 31:57.520
will happen here.

31:58.280 --> 32:00.399
We were born to be together.

32:02.040 --> 32:03.960
We are on the same page.

32:04.119 --> 32:05.899
Aren't we fated?

32:05.919 --> 32:07.599
Is this what you think?

32:09.079 --> 32:10.420
Our wedding comes after the spring exam.

32:10.440 --> 32:12.940
Afterward, I will take over
the Imperial Treasury.

32:12.960 --> 32:16.040
The spring exam is the only way
to obstruct me.

32:16.840 --> 32:18.180
Have you come up with a solution?

32:18.200 --> 32:19.560
Yes, indeed.

32:19.800 --> 32:21.599
I'm waiting for Li Chengze's next move.

32:22.680 --> 32:24.280
You ought to be careful.

32:25.280 --> 32:27.980
It doesn't matter if you lose.

32:28.000 --> 32:28.660
At worst,

32:28.680 --> 32:29.859
we resign

32:29.879 --> 32:31.300
and go wandering the world.

32:38.559 --> 32:40.299
As long as you are with me.

32:40.319 --> 32:43.480
Hands off.
You don't want to mess this up.

32:44.280 --> 32:45.660
Speaking of which,

32:45.680 --> 32:47.550
I have been looking at this
since just now.

32:48.559 --> 32:50.040
What is this?

32:50.440 --> 32:52.160
Mandarin ducks playing in the pond.

32:57.559 --> 32:58.879
They are Mandarin ducks?

33:05.639 --> 33:07.720
Well, it's good.

33:07.760 --> 33:08.840
Pretty good.

33:09.240 --> 33:10.619
No need for an excuse.

33:10.639 --> 33:12.480
It's my problem.

33:13.480 --> 33:15.020
When I was learning embroidery,

33:15.040 --> 33:17.320
I liked to do flowers,
leaves, and rocks.

33:17.639 --> 33:19.679
I didn't like living things.

33:20.200 --> 33:21.720
So it's too hard

33:21.919 --> 33:23.260
if I want to learn now.

33:23.280 --> 33:24.760
You don't have to learn that.

33:25.240 --> 33:26.599
Here. Drink some water.

33:28.879 --> 33:30.379
This is for you.

33:30.399 --> 33:32.260
So I must embroider Mandarin ducks.

33:32.280 --> 33:33.520
For me?

33:34.319 --> 33:35.680
This is the wedding custom.

33:35.700 --> 33:37.280
How come there is such a custom?

33:37.800 --> 33:39.480
It's an unwritten rule.

33:39.520 --> 33:41.480
This is what all noble ladies do.

33:44.720 --> 33:46.280
Why didn't you learn this before?

33:48.839 --> 33:52.320
I used to think I couldn't live
long enough to get married.

33:59.950 --> 34:01.200
We are almost there.

34:02.280 --> 34:04.800
We will get married
when the spring exam is over.

34:06.399 --> 34:07.400
By then,

34:07.420 --> 34:09.480
I will embroider
a fine pair of Mandarin ducks.

34:12.359 --> 34:14.919
Why didn't you like embroidering
living things back then?

34:17.200 --> 34:18.580
Even if

34:18.600 --> 34:20.240
I could create vivid embroidery,

34:20.680 --> 34:22.240
they were not living anyway.

34:22.439 --> 34:24.519
It felt like they were trapped here.

34:25.760 --> 34:27.819
When I was little,
I was confined to the palace

34:27.839 --> 34:29.060
and to this sick body

34:29.080 --> 34:30.660
with nowhere to go.

34:30.680 --> 34:32.120
They reminded me

34:32.359 --> 34:33.839
of myself.

34:34.439 --> 34:35.800
It felt uncomfortable.

34:41.800 --> 34:42.999
It's all right now.

34:43.120 --> 34:44.640
I have you.

34:48.560 --> 34:50.080
I grew up in Danzhou.

34:51.519 --> 34:53.439
It's a harbor city.

34:54.839 --> 34:57.359
Many shops come and go every day.

35:00.039 --> 35:01.879
When the sun sets,

35:02.439 --> 35:04.600
the birds fly along with the wind.

35:07.600 --> 35:10.359
The sight is full of lives.

35:15.600 --> 35:18.080
I have never seen one like that before.

35:20.720 --> 35:21.919
To be honest,

35:23.080 --> 35:25.160
I have never left the Capital before.

35:25.479 --> 35:26.720
After we get married,

35:27.160 --> 35:28.359
I will take you there.

35:32.919 --> 35:34.519
I have always had a dream.

35:36.080 --> 35:36.959
When all troubles

35:36.959 --> 35:38.839
can't hold me back anymore,

35:41.479 --> 35:44.399
I will take you to see
all the fine views around the world.

35:45.720 --> 35:47.200
The day will come.

36:24.879 --> 36:25.999
Sir,

36:26.160 --> 36:27.090
do you have a vacant room?

36:27.110 --> 36:28.660
There wasn't any room left
when I came yesterday.

36:28.680 --> 36:30.080
The waiter told me to come this morning

36:30.080 --> 36:30.979
to try my luck.

36:30.999 --> 36:32.120
One moment.

36:33.300 --> 36:35.459
[Shi Chanli, from Shijia Town,
Cangzhou, Hebei Province]

36:35.479 --> 36:36.540
Mr. Shi?

36:36.560 --> 36:38.060
It's me, Shi Chanli.

36:38.080 --> 36:39.140
You are lucky.

36:39.160 --> 36:40.620
A customer just checked out.

36:40.640 --> 36:42.039
There is an empty

36:42.039 --> 36:43.399
quad room.

36:44.439 --> 36:45.580
To be honest,

36:45.600 --> 36:46.899
the spring exam is approaching.

36:46.919 --> 36:48.379
It's not easy to find a room

36:48.399 --> 36:50.580
in the Capital now.

36:50.600 --> 36:51.780
The quad room

36:51.800 --> 36:53.260
may be a little noisy,

36:53.280 --> 36:55.680
but the fee is cheaper.

36:57.479 --> 37:00.060
Are you here for the spring exam?

37:00.080 --> 37:01.060
Yes, of course.

37:01.080 --> 37:02.459
You are a candidate.

37:02.479 --> 37:04.540
May I take a look
at your official document?

37:04.560 --> 37:06.039
I didn't mean anything.

37:06.480 --> 37:07.819
It's because of the strict inspection

37:07.839 --> 37:09.680
as the spring exam is near.

37:09.919 --> 37:12.640
We have to take note of the details.

37:13.039 --> 37:15.260
The authority might come
to inspect later.

37:15.280 --> 37:16.680
Yes, of course.

37:19.400 --> 37:22.145
[Shi Chanli]

37:22.240 --> 37:23.320
Sir.

37:23.760 --> 37:25.899
Do you have a cheaper room?

37:25.919 --> 37:27.380
Even cheaper?

37:27.400 --> 37:28.939
It's fine I don't stay
with other customers.

37:28.959 --> 37:30.359
Don't stay with others?

37:30.640 --> 37:32.100
We don't have rooms like this.

37:32.120 --> 37:34.559
Well, are there services

37:35.160 --> 37:36.800
like you pay for me?

37:38.830 --> 37:40.299
Please don't get me wrong, sir.

37:40.319 --> 37:42.379
I'm saying that I work as a janitor

37:42.399 --> 37:43.700
or an attendant here.

37:43.720 --> 37:45.780
I can work to cover the fee.

37:45.800 --> 37:47.060
Sorry, Mr. Shi.

37:47.080 --> 37:48.700
We have enough workers here.

37:48.720 --> 37:50.740
I will talk about this man.

37:50.760 --> 37:52.459
He ranked way behind me

37:52.479 --> 37:55.419
in the provincial exam.

37:55.439 --> 37:58.220
Unexpectedly, he rose to fame

37:58.240 --> 38:00.959
in the metropolitan exam.

38:03.080 --> 38:05.680
Mr. Shi, are you facing
a financial pinch?

38:05.760 --> 38:06.660
Frankly,

38:06.680 --> 38:08.919
the spring exam is a money pit.

38:09.319 --> 38:11.660
I know there is a solution.

38:11.680 --> 38:12.380
Please tell me, sir.

38:12.400 --> 38:15.360
There is this official
who holds the current spring exam.

38:15.720 --> 38:18.540
If you can meet him,

38:18.560 --> 38:20.780
he might help you.

38:20.800 --> 38:22.200
Who is hosting

38:22.560 --> 38:23.919
the spring exam?

38:26.690 --> 38:27.919
Mr. Fan,

38:28.200 --> 38:29.600
how have you been?

38:29.839 --> 38:31.830
People were amazed

38:31.850 --> 38:33.750
only when they heard
of your poetry fame.

38:33.879 --> 38:35.559
But it's different for me.

38:35.680 --> 38:37.839
When I first set my eyes on you,

38:38.280 --> 38:40.180
I knew your talent

38:40.200 --> 38:42.039
could be peerless.

38:50.280 --> 38:51.519
Who are you?

38:52.160 --> 38:53.240
Mr. Fan.

38:53.959 --> 38:55.680
It's me, He Zongwei.

38:55.680 --> 38:57.800
[He Zongwei, student in the Capital]
We met before.

38:58.760 --> 39:00.240
He...

39:00.519 --> 39:02.919
Oh, He Zongwei. It rings a bell.

39:03.160 --> 39:04.580
You helped Guo Baokun

39:04.600 --> 39:06.200
to sue me in the Capital Magistrate.

39:06.200 --> 39:07.280
Was it you?

39:08.399 --> 39:10.940
Mr. Fan, the Guo family compelled me.

39:10.960 --> 39:11.959
Well, enough. Stop kneeling.

39:11.959 --> 39:13.080
I could only pretend to agree.

39:13.080 --> 39:15.700
In fact, deep inside me,
I despised that.

39:15.720 --> 39:17.120
Get him up.

39:17.160 --> 39:18.100
Enough.

39:18.120 --> 39:19.919
Stand up and talk. Come on.

39:21.039 --> 39:22.220
Thank you, Mr. Wang.

39:22.240 --> 39:23.879
You say you are He Zongwei.

39:23.879 --> 39:26.919
But you look different now.

39:28.399 --> 39:29.879
Faces reflect our thoughts.

39:30.400 --> 39:32.020
Now that I have gotten rid
of the Guo family,

39:32.040 --> 39:33.640
I have become more ambitious

39:34.519 --> 39:36.160
and have a generous-looking face.

39:36.399 --> 39:38.419
Are you saying
that it's the Guo family's fault

39:38.439 --> 39:39.680
and you are clean?

39:40.439 --> 39:42.080
Exactly, Mr. Fan.

39:42.479 --> 39:44.939
I wanted to record
the evildoing of the Guo family

39:44.959 --> 39:46.560
and report it to you one day

39:46.580 --> 39:47.780
to uproot the evil of the country.

39:47.800 --> 39:49.559
But why didn't you report anything?

39:52.200 --> 39:54.600
Well, you acted too quickly.

39:54.640 --> 39:56.479
Guo Youzhi is already in prison,

39:56.560 --> 39:58.939
while I have already
escaped the evil clutch.

39:58.959 --> 40:00.120
It's all

40:00.999 --> 40:02.760
thanks to you, Mr. Fan.

40:03.319 --> 40:06.299
You are like a father to me.

40:06.319 --> 40:07.830
No. You look older than me.

40:07.850 --> 40:08.980
A father who guides my spirit.

40:09.000 --> 40:10.260
Is this a family reunion or something?

40:10.280 --> 40:12.819
I would like to use all my knowledge
to serve the Qing State,

40:12.839 --> 40:13.740
His Majesty,

40:13.760 --> 40:14.560
and you...

40:14.560 --> 40:15.680
Stop right there!

40:16.519 --> 40:18.039
You are a candidate, right?

40:22.200 --> 40:23.320
Yes.

40:24.959 --> 40:26.320
What did you come here for?

40:27.240 --> 40:28.519
Please be my mentor.

40:28.600 --> 40:30.240
You possess shocking talents,

40:30.399 --> 40:32.280
and you rescued my lost soul.

40:32.519 --> 40:35.340
We scholars have deep faith
in great virtues.

40:35.360 --> 40:37.320
If I can't seek an apprenticeship
from you,

40:37.800 --> 40:38.540
this is

40:38.560 --> 40:40.479
simply unconscionable!

40:43.200 --> 40:45.160
So you know I'm the examiner?

40:46.680 --> 40:48.200
Absolutely not, Mr. Fan.

40:48.479 --> 40:50.879
I genuinely admire you, sir.

40:51.280 --> 40:52.859
You know me well.

40:52.879 --> 40:55.140
I strictly carry myself
with dignity and etiquette.

40:55.160 --> 40:56.899
If it wasn't for you,

40:56.919 --> 40:59.680
I wouldn't have brought myself to kneel.

40:59.680 --> 41:01.459
Stand up and talk to me, then.

41:01.479 --> 41:02.800
I will speak on my knees.

41:02.999 --> 41:04.559
I came here with pure sincerity.

41:04.879 --> 41:06.600
Will you

41:06.999 --> 41:09.200
take me as your adopted son?

41:09.359 --> 41:12.220
I'm willing to serve by your side
every day,

41:12.240 --> 41:13.540
Godfather.

41:13.560 --> 41:14.919
First you wanted me to be your mentor,

41:14.919 --> 41:16.479
and now godfather.

41:16.999 --> 41:18.079
Godfather,

41:18.160 --> 41:19.859
I have been struggling

41:19.879 --> 41:21.260
and helpless.

41:21.280 --> 41:23.439
Please grant me my wish, Godfather.

41:23.680 --> 41:24.760
Mr. Fan.

41:25.680 --> 41:26.839
Get up already.

41:32.999 --> 41:34.079
Mr. Fan,

41:34.879 --> 41:36.939
a secret missive
from the First Division.

41:36.959 --> 41:38.760
Do you still remember the Shijia Town?

41:39.280 --> 41:41.220
Of course,
the entire town was wiped out.

41:41.240 --> 41:42.879
There is a survivor now.

41:43.800 --> 41:44.439
[The only survivor of Shijia Town,
Shi Chanli, left the Capital for the exam]

41:44.439 --> 41:46.080
[and arrived yesterday.]
Shi Chanli?

41:47.120 --> 41:48.819
He came to the Capital
for the spring exam

41:48.839 --> 41:50.800
before the Shijia Town was burned,

41:50.839 --> 41:52.700
so he is the only survivor

41:52.720 --> 41:54.720
of the Shijia Town.

41:54.879 --> 41:55.860
He arrived yesterday.

41:55.880 --> 41:57.060
According to the rules,

41:57.080 --> 41:59.060
a student needs to verify his identity

41:59.080 --> 42:00.899
before checking in.

42:00.919 --> 42:01.810
Deng Ziyue got the news

42:01.830 --> 42:03.399
and sent this over immediately.

42:05.240 --> 42:07.160
The only survivor.

42:17.280 --> 42:19.439
The only survivor of the Shijia Town

42:19.839 --> 42:21.220
has come to the Capital.

42:21.240 --> 42:22.800
He stays in an inn here.

42:23.600 --> 42:24.750
Your Highness,

42:25.600 --> 42:26.800
shall I go there?

42:26.879 --> 42:27.859
Why?

42:27.879 --> 42:30.439
Killing a student is easy.

42:31.439 --> 42:33.020
Why do you want to kill him?

42:33.040 --> 42:34.479
Shouldn't we silence him?

42:36.280 --> 42:37.879
I told you

42:38.319 --> 42:40.700
I didn't set the fire in Shijia Town.

42:40.720 --> 42:42.800
Still, he is the survivor.

42:42.880 --> 42:45.620
Fan Xian is still investigating
your past deal with Northern Qi.

42:45.640 --> 42:47.399
All the more reason not to kill him.

42:47.439 --> 42:50.120
The Imperial Inspectorate surely knows
about this by now as you do.

42:50.879 --> 42:52.399
Let him investigate.

42:53.319 --> 42:55.879
I'm also curious about

42:56.919 --> 42:58.720
who set that fire.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
